     <p style="margin-top:7px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;">各区、县（市）教育局，教研室，市直学校，在绍高校：</span></p><p style="margin-top:7px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px;text-indent:36px"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px;">为全面落实浙江省</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 1px;">“</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -2px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px;">新时代真理的味道</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 1px;">——</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px;">溯源铸魂育新</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px;">人</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px;">”</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -3px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px;">思想政治教育工作部署会精神要求，根据我院</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -5px;"> </span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px;">2</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 2px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px;">号文件精神，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px;">对</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -4px;"> </span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 1px;">2026 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px;">年绍兴市大中小学思政教育一体化建设关于</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 1px;">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px;">越思政</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 1px;">”</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -4px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px;">金课、课程思政案例、大思政育人品牌案例、</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 1px;">“</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -2px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px;">我眼中的中国式现代化</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 1px;">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px;">研学成果案例征集、评审、展示活动的具体要求，作具体</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px;">补充，现将有关事宜通知如下：</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-right:24px;margin-bottom:5px"><span style="font-family: 黑体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px;">一<span style="font-family: 黑体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">、征集对象范围</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-right:24px;margin-bottom:5px;text-indent:32px"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">区、县（市）教育行政部门、教研部门及中小幼职学校；普通高等学校；</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">走读绍兴</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -3px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">实践基地、绍兴市大中小学思政课一体</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px;">化建设研学基地、爱国主义教育基地等。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px"><span style="font-family: 黑体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px;">二、征集内容要求</span></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px;text-indent:32px"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">总体要求：</span></strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">以习近平总书记在绍兴的足迹为路径，循迹溯源，</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">入脑入心，重点关注</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">枫桥经验</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">及进校园、进课堂的实践与探索，以</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">德治、法治、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: -6px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">自治、智治</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -4px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">为主线，挖掘内在思政元素，鼓励</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px;">统一主题、贯通学段的一体化教育教学实践案例。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:5px;margin-bottom:5px;margin-left:4px;text-indent:39px"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">（一）</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">越思政</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">金课。</span><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: -6px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">围绕习近平中国特色社会主义思想，以</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -2px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">总书记在绍兴的足迹</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -4px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">和</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">枫桥经验</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -4px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">为载体，以《习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想（学生读本）》或《习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想概论》课程为教学内容，开展金课的教学设计，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px;">进行专题教学，最终形成教学视频。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px;margin-left:4px;text-indent:39px"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">（二）课程思政。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">围绕习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想，以</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -2px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">总书记在绍兴的足迹</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -4px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">和</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">枫桥经验</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -4px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">为载体，以案例的形式反</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px;">映学科与思政的融合，形成课程思政的全科育人目标。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-right:5px;margin-bottom:5px;margin-left:2px;text-indent:41px"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">（</span><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: -5px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">三）大思政育人品牌。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">党建带领团建、队建，彰显学校办学特色，遵循学生成长规律，加强主渠道与主阵地协同，深化思政课程、课程思政与日常思政的融合，做好各学段纵向衔接和校内外横向贯通，形成学校思政育人的特色做法。以典型案例的形式，提炼学校大思政育人品牌。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:6px;margin-bottom:5px;margin-left:0;text-indent:43px"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">（</span><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: -4px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">四）</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">我眼中的中国式现代化</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">研学成果。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">开展大中小学生</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px;">研学活动，特别是利用暑假集中开展大手拉小手循迹溯源</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -2px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px;">田野思政</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -2px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 16px;">实践研学，探寻总书记在绍兴的足迹，讲好总书记与绍兴</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">的故事；考察标志性建设成果，感受绍兴改革开放以来的伟大成就；访谈改革开放以来涌现出来的</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -3px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">三支队伍</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">优秀榜样、劳动模范，感悟创新精神、劳模精神等等。透过浙江</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">“</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: -2px; font-size: 16px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">重要窗口</span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">”</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">看绍兴发展，让大中小学生进一步深刻感受、领悟中国式现代化建设的伟大成果。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:5px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px"><span style="font-family: 黑体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 18px;">三、征集程序</span></p><p style="margin-top:15px;margin-right:10px;margin-bottom:5px;margin-left:12px;text-indent:41px"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">（一）申报。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 16px;">各部门认真做好宣传发动工作，保质保量组织完成申报，不接受个人申报。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:5px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:5px;margin-left:53px;text-indent:0"><span style="font-family: 楷体; letter-spacing: 1px